{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e01-scene-13",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "ラブ、グッド、ハロー  (Love, Good, and Hello)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "nakai": "中井",
    "muranishi": "村西"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Seated on the tatami mat across from the terrifying Nakai, Muranishi is trembling from head to toe. Remembering Ono's lesson, he praises Nakai as one of a kind and promises that three tiny English words are enough to talk with foreigners—until his tongue slips. Listen to this high-wire pitch.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "すいません、すいません！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "失礼いたしました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nakai",
      "t": "早く説明しろよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はい。ご主人、とてもビューティフォーです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "特別なオーラでオンリーワンでございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nakai",
      "t": "そうかもな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "最近、海外との取り引きも増えたのではないでしょうか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そこでこのエンサイクロペディアが役に立ちます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ラブ、グッド、ハロー、短い単語を覚えるだけです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "それで外国人と話すことができます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nakai",
      "t": "その三つなら俺でも覚えられそうだな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "小学生でも覚えることができますから。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Muranishi swings from formal apologies to bold sales claims—and walks right into trouble on the final line. Let's inspect each piece.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "失礼いたしました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''Please forgive my rudeness.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nakai",
      "t": "早く説明しろよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''Hurry up and explain it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はい。ご主人、とてもビューティフォーです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''Yes! Sir, it looks truly beautiful on you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "特別なオーラでオンリーワンでございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''With its special aura, it is truly one of a kind.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nakai",
      "t": "そうかもな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''Maybe you are right.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そこでこのエンサイクロペディアが役に立ちます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''That is right where this encyclopedia comes in handy.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ラブ、グッド、ハロー、短い単語を覚えるだけです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''Love, good, hello—you just memorize short words like these.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "それで外国人と話すことができます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''With just that, you can speak with foreigners.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nakai",
      "t": "その三つなら俺でも覚えられそうだな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''If it is just those three, even I could probably learn them.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "小学生でも覚えることができますから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''Because even a grade-schooler can learn them!'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "すいません、すいません！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "失礼いたしました。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "nakai",
      "t": "早く説明しろよ。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はい。ご主人、とてもビューティフォーです。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "特別なオーラでオンリーワンでございます。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "nakai",
      "t": "そうかもな。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "最近、海外との取り引きも増えたのではないでしょうか？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そこでこのエンサイクロペディアが役に立ちます。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ラブ、グッド、ハロー、短い単語を覚えるだけです。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "それで外国人と話すことができます。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "nakai",
      "t": "その三つなら俺でも覚えられそうだな。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "小学生でも覚えることができますから。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Keep the formal phrase for apologies, the expression when something comes in handy, and the polite phrasing to talk about languages you can speak. Let's see how Muranishi rescues himself in scene fourteen.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "また会いましょう。",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
